    "body": "Reopened. The merge of #3872 (`1fe369fab`, 11:53:05Z) closed this issue from `Fixes #3748` in the PR body.\n\nPin 1 as written is not met in one configuration. The review of #3872 proved that a user-selected Helix, Ramp or Plunge still runs, with an advisory `Warning::EntryNotRecommended`. A selected Ramp makes a ramp move below the material top, so `start_side_pass_has_no_helix_or_ramp` is not green for that configuration.\n\nThe Arc clause is delivered: #3843 is closed and #3858 is on `main`.\n\nClose this issue again in one of two ways:\n1. pin 1 is green for every configuration, or\n2. a sentence on this issue says that pin 1 covers the automatic entry, and a selected Ramp is allowed with its warning. Then the done criterion is true and the close is right.\n\nI asked for one of these on the PR before the merge (comment 7130317911). Neither was applied.\n",
    "author_association": "OWNER",
