    "body": "<!-- issue-sweep: DONE -->\nIssue sweep: already done on main: 1fe369fab (PR #3872), 29488d99c (PR #3858).\n\n- `dead_end_ramp`, `ramp_starts`, and `level_ramp_entry.rs` are gone from `crates/motion/src/machining2d/`. Tests `start_side_pass_has_no_automatic_ramp`, `outside_entries_after_the_first_land_in_cleared_stock`, and `a_short_dead_end_no_longer_falls_back_to_auto` in `crates/motion/tests/pass_start_engagement.rs` pin this.\n- A selected `Helix`, `Ramp`, or `Plunge` runs and posts one `Warning::EntryNotRecommended` (`crates/sim/src/verify/entry_advice.rs`, `crates/app/src/operation/generate.rs`). `Arc` makes no helix, no ramp, and no warning. Tests `a_selected_entry_is_kept_and_named_once` and `the_arc_entry_has_no_helix_or_ramp_and_no_advice` in `crates/motion/tests/pass_start_engagement.rs`, `the_advice_note_posts_one_advisory_warning` and `fig8_outside_selected_helix_warns_once_and_arc_not_at_all` in `crates/app/tests/offset_pass_start/entry_advice.rs`, and `the_advice_names_the_selected_and_the_recommended_type` in `crates/sim/src/verify/entry_advice.rs` pin this.\n- The Lead in / Lead out page keeps all entry types active and shows the advice (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/lead_page.rs`). Test `the_leads_tab_advises_arc_next_to_the_entry_type_for_inside_and_outside` in `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/pass_start.rs` pins this.\n- A seeded 2D Offset switches to `Arc` for Inside and Outside (`29488d99c`, PR #3858, closing #3843). Tests in `crates/app/tests/offset_pass_start/start_side_entry.rs` pin this.\n- `docs/decisions/3748-entry-warnings.md` records that `#3741` and `#3748` supersede the `#3567` decision (`docs/decisions/3567-ramp-entry-at-dead-end.md` moved to `RECOMMENDED.md` in `7369829be`).\n- Comment 7132488697 meets reopen option 2 from comment 7130732075: pin 1 covers the automatic entry, and a selected `Ramp` runs with its warning. Issue #3884 tracks the plain Outside pocket follow-up.\n",
    "author_association": "COLLABORATOR",
