    "body": "Decision (coordinator, unattended, option 2 of the reopen comment): pin 1 covers the automatic entry. A user-selected Helix, Ramp or Plunge is permitted and gives `Warning::EntryNotRecommended`, as the title of this issue says. Thus the done criterion is true.\n\nThe work is on `main`: `1fe369fab` (PR #3872) and `29488d99c` (PR #3858). The issue sweep of 2026-11-25 confirmed the pins on `main`.\n\nDropped: option 1 (pin 1 green for each configuration). It removes an entry that the user selected.",
